WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500 line:-3
Left: the booth's desktop. Right: an editor on your computer.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000 line:-3
Open the tab on the left edge, then click the Clipboard button.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.800 line:-3
The Clipboard panel opens with an empty text box.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000 line:-3
On your computer: select some text and copy it.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.500 line:-3
Paste it into the panel's text box. The booth now has it.

00:19.500 --> 00:22.000 line:-3
Inside the booth: paste into VS Code.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000 line:-3
The text is in the booth app.
